> Many of you have heard me attribute most of my success with 
> Lojban to a memory aid (read: flashcard on steroids) program 
> called SuperMemo, specifically the PalmOS version.
> 
> I've updated my help file on this app (see
> http://www.teddyb.org/~rlpowell/hobbies/lojban/) to include 
> downloads for the PalmOS emulator for Windows.  There are 
> also Mac and Linux versions.  All are free to download.  For 
> the Linux versions, you don't even need to subscribe to the 
> PalmOS dev group.
> 
> If you're serious about learning Lojban, and you're willing 
> to put in the 15 minutes or so a day it takes to properly use 
> this app, I can't reccomend it enough.  You'll still need to 
> buy a copy of MapleTop's SuperMemo, but I'm willing to buy 
> copies for people that really want to use it and really can't 
> afford it (it's vanishingly cheap compared to my current budget).
